<title>USA: Yields on Bond Buyer's weekly indices edge down.</title>
<headline>Yields on Bond Buyer's weekly indices edge down.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices edged down this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday was 5.70 percent, down three basis points from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.60 percent, down three basis points from last week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 5.95 percent, down seven basis points from last week.</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.70%   5.73%   2/6/97</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.60%   5.63%   2/6/97</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 5.95%   6.02%   2/6/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
